    "name": "PIZZDILE",
    "steam_appid": 2694260,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2694260/extras/c21dc7162ccbbd3b00c253d27b360b62.avif?t=1701114692\" width=600 height=200 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PIZZDILE</strong> is a story about a struggle, a friendship and a love for pizza.</h2><br>Joe is a really BIG pizza lover and an great zoologist. He specializes in South American crocodiles. The crocodile, called Henry, with whom they have been friends and eaten pizza since they were young, shares his life credo too. <br><br>One day this peaceful idyll is ruined and Henry gets into big troubles. Joe has to fight to find his friend. And of course he needs to get a couple of yummy slices of pizza along the way.<br><br>Who knows what secrets this journey hides?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2694260/extras/b88859487a40dafd0b53843996f8f5c2.poster.avif?t=1701114692\" width=600 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2694260/extras/b88859487a40dafd0b53843996f8f5c2.webm?t=1701114692\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2694260/extras/b88859487a40dafd0b53843996f8f5c2.mp4?t=1701114692\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Break through hordes of crocodiles to find your friend and pizzas<br></li><li> Eat pizza to recover your health<br></li><li> The best animation of human's belly<br></li><li> Unexpected plot twists<br></li><li> Uncover the underground crocodile network<br></li><li> Fight for your friend! (and pizza)</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2694260/extras/c21dc7162ccbbd3b00c253d27b360b62.avif?t=1701114692\" width=600 height=200 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PIZZDILE</strong> is a story about a struggle, a friendship and a love for pizza.</h2><br>Joe is a really BIG pizza lover and an great zoologist. He specializes in South American crocodiles. The crocodile, called Henry, with whom they have been friends and eaten pizza since they were young, shares his life credo too. <br><br>One day this peaceful idyll is ruined and Henry gets into big troubles. Joe has to fight to find his friend. And of course he needs to get a couple of yummy slices of pizza along the way.<br><br>Who knows what secrets this journey hides?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2694260/extras/b88859487a40dafd0b53843996f8f5c2.poster.avif?t=1701114692\" width=600 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2694260/extras/b88859487a40dafd0b53843996f8f5c2.webm?t=1701114692\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2694260/extras/b88859487a40dafd0b53843996f8f5c2.mp4?t=1701114692\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Break through hordes of crocodiles to find your friend and pizzas<br></li><li> Eat pizza to recover your health<br></li><li> The best animation of human's belly<br></li><li> Unexpected plot twists<br></li><li> Uncover the underground crocodile network<br></li><li> Fight for your friend! (and pizza)</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "The Jungle is a dangerous and beautiful place. Can you survive alongside hordes of crocodiles, fighting for survival and the chance to eat delicious pizza? The meme about crocodiles and pizza is being taken to the next level.",
